#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:15
msgid "What has been changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:17
msgid ""
"Since namespaces have been added to CodeIgniter 4, the controllers must "
"be changed to support namespaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:18
msgid ""
"The constructor of CI4 Controller does not automatically load core "
"classes into the properties."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:19
msgid ""
"CI4's Controller has a special constructor :ref:`initController() "
"<controller-constructor>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:20
msgid ""
"CI4 provides :doc:`Request </incoming/incomingrequest>` and "
":doc:`Responses </outgoing/response>` objects for you to work with - more"
" powerful than the CI3-way."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:22
msgid ""
"If you want a base controller (``MY_Controller`` in CI3), use "
"**app/Controllers/BaseController.php**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:23
msgid ""
"Calling ``echo`` within Controllers, as in CI3, is still supported, but "
"it is recommended that a string or Response object be returned from "
"Controllers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:27
msgid "Upgrade Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:29
msgid "First, move all controller files to the folder **app/Controllers**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:30
msgid ""
"Add this line just after the opening php tag: ``namespace "
"App\\Controllers;``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:31
msgid "Replace ``extends CI_Controller`` with ``extends BaseController``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:32
msgid ""
"Remove the line ``defined('BASEPATH') OR exit('No direct script access "
"allowed');`` if it exists."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:34
msgid ""
"If you use sub-directories in your controller structure, you have to "
"change the namespace according to that."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:38
msgid ""
"For example, you have a version 3 controller located in "
"**application/controllers/users/auth/Register.php**, the namespace has to"
" be ``namespace App\\Controllers\\Users\\Auth;`` and the controller path "
"in the version 4 should look like this: "
"**app/Controllers/Users/Auth/Register.php**. Make sure to have the first "
"letters of the sub-directories as capitalized."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:40
msgid ""
"After that you have to insert a ``use`` statement below the namespace "
"definition in order to extend the ``BaseController``: ``use "
"App\\Controllers\\BaseController;``"
msgstr ""

